        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "You can now take apart every *-lı* word on that list yourself: *asansör-lü* (with elevator), *balkon-lu*, *doğalgaz-lı*. Turkish property ads are really grammar practice in disguise."
        },
        {
          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "Unit 16 review",
          "items": [
            "Cover the Turkish and rebuild these from memory: \"What's the weather like?\" · \"Today is colder than yesterday.\" · \"Is there anything cheaper?\" · \"I think Turkish is easier.\" · \"It's snowing.\"",
            "Then compare: *İstanbul / Ankara / büyük* and *yaz / kış / sıcak*."
          ]
